r\">#19</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE1DcW9BTFM5WW9adGNUUFRUQTJlaHRNMkpCcC1hTzg0U0RiOFhFM01oRDZ0Z1pZZ2FmRkpDYjBYUWZNRTRpNmI3SWo1M1BkS3NxcVVHMk5obFRKMXc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#20</a>]. 이에 따라 원·달러 환율은 중동 긴장과 국채 금리 상승 영향으로 전 거래일 대비 1.8원 오른 1370.4원으로 상승 마감했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE0zcDAtSktUNUxhdFRqcGFKM2h0TFp6T1lzWjVoN083NWNBLTRyR3FETnk5eTBxcjV0cjJJa2VNc28xLWZsMkQ3LVl1V2JCZjhLYTVlVVlHU09vVXPSAWBBVV95cUxPYk5rMWQ3VGFPYmZvQVRzVzd6dFNkbUVRWGZhQm9wMWNEczJZODRvWXBIWkEyNElqTkNZeERuUzlBNXFMZ3dSUEZFdmJSS2s1RW44MC1Pc2dMdXNvVWF6eFY?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#8</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#11</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#16</a>].\n\n<b>트럼프의 연준 금리 인하 압박</b>\n도널드 트럼프 전 대통령이 연준 의장 후보군을 향해 미국의 금리가 세계에서 가장 낮아야 한다며 강력한 인하 압박을 가하고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE5BOGstSWxvclhoc095bUp1WXZfOE0yUThwTjYza01iVGpsZDJfNzMzcXN1a2hjTEJMSTl6LTlMbFFacHNpNTN5ZXcwVktrTXVGckVwaVdKMXByXzVqVjdXeg?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#27</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE16T2tKVFpfLVkyYjh4SWFXUTFKZTJWdjhtN2k4a3V5ZzJDTnVOa2x0WUE4NV8tTHJLamV6QTV6cXRHTW1JN05FUjJMV1lfZDNPc0pDVW9Pc01Jbl9LQTBrVGVNZ1ktVlotekpwOEZVRQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#34</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE1ydlpUX3J6NG9EZzV3bzFZSnNuLUZVaXJXcnV4bUVnd2hqeGUxZktSNl82UW9xVXQ1eDVsRmk1LU5NaXlkdGliVUlWNFJxNnh4QlN0S2VWTFJjVnpB?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#35</a>]. 이러한 발언은 시장의 장기 금리 급등 압력으로 작용하며 변동성을 키우고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE5vRDR5M0FmNzd0WERWdUg0OXFyNHo2R19YMU9UT2dOQk1IWmU3UjVmR05XaWlxVFh4ajJTZUtCZWw2OF9KWFJXY0Q2d1FScFJJcGw1amJ5azFHQ2ZVWlJUVlcteXVOdjdtX1pRQldTcVEtUQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#29</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi